      "content": "thanks. so i've been on the omeprazole for a while now and it usually keeps the gnawing feeling under control. you think it'll totally protect my stomach if i take the advil with some food? i'm just worried because the stomach pain has been there for a bit and i dont want to make it way worse or something like an ulcer or whatever.",
